{"work_id":"manohara","scene_id":"manohara-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/manohara/scenes/scene-025.md","record_count":9,"records":[{"id":"manohara-s025-d001","scene_id":"manohara-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"வசந்தா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம், நாளை மனோகரனுக்கு வெற்றிவிழா வரவேற்பு!...அப்போது நான் விதவையைப் போல ஒரு மூலையில்......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"manohara-s025-d002","scene_id":"manohara-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"அரசன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"(சங்கடத்துடன்).........வசந்தி! இப்படியெல்லாம் பேசாதே - சகலகெளரவத்தோடும் நீ சபைக்கு வரலாம்......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"manohara-s025-d003","scene_id":"manohara-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வரலாமா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"manohara-s025-d004","scene_id":"manohara-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"அர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...வரலாம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"manohara-s025-d005","scene_id":"manohara-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...தயக்கம் பிறந்துவிட்டது...பாவம்! நீங்கள் என்ன செய்வீர்கள். சபையோர்கள் அனுமதிக்க மாட்டார்கள். சக்கரவர்த்தியாயிருந்தாலென்ன சாதாரண பிரஜைகளுக்கு பயப்பட வேண்டியவர்தானே தாங்கள்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"manohara-s025-d006","scene_id":"manohara-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"அர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இல்லை...வரலாம்......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"manohara-s025-d007","scene_id":"manohara-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வரலாம்!... எங்கே வந்தால் என்ன? எதிரி நாட்டிலே இருந்து வந்திருக்கிற அந்த ரத்ன சிம்மாசனத்திலே அல்லும், பகலும் உங்கள் அன்பையே நினைத்து தவம் இருக்கும் இந்த தரித்திரம் பிடித்தவள் பட்டமகிஷிபோல பக்கத்திலே அமர முடியுமா என்ன? அவ்வளவுக்கு கொடுத்து வைத்த பாவியா நான்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"manohara-s025-d008","scene_id":"manohara-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"அர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பக்கத்திலென்ன—பரமசிவனைப் போல பலமிருந்தால் உன்னை என் தலையில்கூட வைத்துக் கொள்வேன், கங்கையைப் போல!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"manohara-s025-d009","scene_id":"manohara-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்படியானால் நாளை...... தர்பாரில்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"}]}